T*
(   Accepted employees, spouse or declared partner, up to two dependent children, and) Tj
T*
(   enrolled parents or parents-in-law where shown on the member certificate.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(BEN-1.3  Base sum insured) Tj
T*
(   INR 500,000 family floater per policy year for employee, spouse and children. Enrolled) Tj
T*
(   parents or parents-in-law use a separate INR 300,000 parental floater.) Tj
