(3. ROOM-RENT AND PROPORTIONATE DEDUCTION) Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
(Apply this calculation only after confirming the selected room exceeded entitlement.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(BEN-3.1  Ratio) Tj
T*
(   Room eligibility ratio equals eligible daily room limit divided by actual daily room) Tj
T*
(   charge, capped at one hundred percent.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(BEN-3.2  Related variable charges) Tj
T*
(   The ratio may apply to room-linked nursing, surgeon, physician and operation theatre) Tj
T*
(   charges only when the provider tariff demonstrably varies by room category.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(BEN-3.3  Protected charges) Tj
T*
(   The ratio must not reduce medicines at MRP, implants with regulated price, diagnostics) Tj
T*
(   with fixed tariff, ambulance, or another charge not linked to room category.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(BEN-3.4  Waiver conditions) Tj
T*
(   No proportionate deduction applies when no eligible room was available in a documented) Tj
T*
(   emergency or when the schedule endorsement waives the room restriction.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
endstream
