T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
(Waiting periods are counted from the member continuous coverage date and may be modified by) Tj
T*
(endorsement.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(BEN-4.1  Initial waiting period) Tj
T*
(   Thirty days for illness claims. The initial waiting period does not apply to accidental) Tj
T*
(   injury treatment.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(BEN-4.2  Specified conditions) Tj
T*
(   Twenty-four months for cataract, hernia, piles, sinusitis, gallstones, kidney stones,) Tj
T*
(   hysterectomy for non-malignant conditions, and joint replacement unless caused solely by) Tj
T*
(   an accident.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(BEN-4.3  Pre-existing disease) Tj
T*
(   Thirty-six months of continuous coverage unless waived or reduced by endorsement.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(BEN-4.4  Maternity) Tj
T*
(   Nine months unless waived by employer endorsement.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(BEN-4.5  Continuity credit) Tj
T*
(   Prior continuous coverage credit must be verified from accepted evidence and applied) Tj
T*
(   according to the endorsement and applicable rules.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
