(5. RESTORATION AND AGGREGATE CONTROLS) Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
(Restoration prevents avoidable exhaustion but does not erase sublimits.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(BEN-5.1  Restoration amount) Tj
T*
(   One restoration of one hundred percent of the base family floater may activate after) Tj
T*
(   partial or full exhaustion during the policy year.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(BEN-5.2  Use conditions) Tj
T*
(   Restored balance may be used for a later hospitalization. It cannot be used for the same) Tj
T*
(   hospitalization and does not replenish maternity, cataract, AYUSH or another) Tj
T*
(   benefit-specific annual sublimit.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(BEN-5.3  Carry forward) Tj
T*
(   Unused restoration expires at policy-year end and cannot be carried forward or converted) Tj
T*
(   to cash.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
endstream
